          #bar #pdf{flex:2;background:var(--ac);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ac)}
          </style></head><body>
          <div class="hint">Kisi bhi text par tap karke edit karein. Logo par tap karke apna logo lagayein. Niche "PDF" dabayein.</div>
          <div id="stage"><div id="sheet">
          <div class="hd"><label class="logo">🕉️<input type="file" accept="image/*"></label>
          <div class="ht"><div class="e cn">SUBH VINAYAK ENTERPRISES</div><div class="e">Vijay complex, Main Road, Banderdewa, Lakhimpur (Assam)</div><div class="e b">GST NO – 18AZJPT3481G2ZV</div></div>
          <label class="logo">🕉️<input type="file" accept="image/*"></label></div>
          <div class="e dl">DEALS IN: - Honda Generator, Rice Mill, Honda Brush Cutter, Still Chain Saw, Bosch Chop Saw, Welding Machine, Car Wash, Glass, Ply Board, Aluminum Section, Hollow bricks machine, C.L.C Plants, Paver &amp; Concrete Bricks, ACC Bricks Machine, Mobile Crusher Machine, Bitumen, Bitumen all in one, All Type of Machine &amp; Power tools With Hardware Goods Sold Here</div>
          <div class="e qt">QUOTATION</div>
          <div class="inf"><table class="L"><tr><td class="e lb" style="width:62px;height:100px;vertical-align:top">TO</td><td class="e pu" id="to" style="vertical-align:top">BAJA YUKPO</td></tr><tr><td class="e lb">GSTIN</td><td class="e c pu">9436042603</td></tr><tr><td class="e lb">PHONE</td><td class="e"></td></tr></table>
          <div class="R"><table><tr><td class="e lb">QT.NO</td><td class="e c rd">SVE/26-27</td><td class="e c b" id="qn">67</td></tr><tr><td class="e lb">DATE:</td><td class="e c b" colspan="2" id="dt"></td></tr><tr><td class="e lb">REF No. (BY)</td><td class="e c b" colspan="2">AJAY TIWARI</td></tr></table>
          <div class="e c pu ph">PH NO-8011324351,8471937303</div></div></div>
          <table><thead><tr id="hdr"><th class="e" style="width:52px">SR. NO</th><th class="e">PARTICULAR</th><th class="e" style="width:76px">UQM.</th><th class="e" style="width:62px">QTY.</th><th class="e" style="width:112px">RATE</th><th class="e" style="width:130px">AMOUNT</th></tr></thead><tbody id="items"></tbody></table>
          <div class="ft"><div class="tc"><div class="e th">Terms &amp; Conditions</div><div class="e">1. All amounts are inclusive gst.<br>2. Transport charge is extra.<br>3. 100% payment in advance with PO.<br>4. Quotation is valid for 30 days only.<br>5. Delivery will be done within 25 days after receiving full payment.</div></div>
